{"seq":3,"slug":"fixed-point-vs-float","title":"定点数与浮点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-replay-determinism/foundations/fixed-point-vs-float","wordCount":1600,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"定点数与浮点\">定点数与浮点</h1><p>「我们要不要全面改用定点数？」几乎每个做确定性联机的团队都在某个阶段开过这场会。争论的核心是一个看似矛盾的事实：IEEE 754 浮点是一个极其精确的标准，却又无法保证「同一段浮点代码在所有机器上给出相同结果」。这一篇把这个矛盾拆开——浮点哪里确定、哪里不确定、能不能驯服，以及定点数到底用什么换什么——好让你在那场会上做出有依据的决定。这是上一篇清单里「数值层」那一项的深入展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>IEEE 754 把一个浮点数表示为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>s</mi></msup><mo>×</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>e</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-1)^s \\times m \\times 2^e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，并且强制规定：加减乘除与平方根必须「正确舍入」——即结果等于「用无限精度算出真值、再舍入到最近的可表示数」。这意味着 <code>a + b</code>、<code>a * b</code> 在任何合规平台上对相同输入给出相同结果。问题不在这些基本运算本身，而在它们之外的三块自由地带：超越函数（<code>sin</code>/<code>cos</code>/<code>exp</code> 的实现精度各异）、表达式的求值与中间精度（编译器可用 80 位扩展寄存器或重排运算）、以及 FMA。下图把「浮点的确定与不确定」一刀切开。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[IEEE 754 浮点] --&gt; B[确定的部分&lt;br/&gt;+ - * / sqrt 正确舍入]&#10;  A --&gt; C[不确定的部分]&#10;  C --&gt; D[超越函数&lt;br/&gt;sin cos exp 实现各异]&#10;  C --&gt; E[中间精度&lt;br/&gt;80位扩展 / 编译器重排]&#10;  C --&gt; F[FMA&lt;br/&gt;一次舍入 vs 两次舍入]&#10;  C --&gt; G[fast-math&lt;br/&gt;假设结合律成立]&#10;  B --&gt; H[可驯服: 软浮点 / 锁定标志]&#10;  D --&gt; I[需自实现数学库]&#10;  E --&gt; H&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; J[直接禁用]\">flowchart TD\n  A[IEEE 754 浮点] --&gt; B[确定的部分&lt;br/&gt;+ - * / sqrt 正确舍入]\n  A --&gt; C[不确定的部分]\n  C --&gt; D[超越函数&lt;br/&gt;sin cos exp 实现各异]\n  C --&gt; E[中间精度&lt;br/&gt;80位扩展 / 编译器重排]\n  C --&gt; F[FMA&lt;br/&gt;一次舍入 vs 两次舍入]\n  C --&gt; G[fast-math&lt;br/&gt;假设结合律成立]\n  B --&gt; H[可驯服: 软浮点 / 锁定标志]\n  D --&gt; I[需自实现数学库]\n  E --&gt; H\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; J[直接禁用]</pre><p>下表把两条路线的取舍并排摆出，这是那场会真正要权衡的东西。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>浮点（驯服后）</th>\n<th>定点数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>跨平台确定性</td>\n<td>需严格约束（禁 FMA/fast-math、自实现超越函数）</td>\n<td>天然确定（纯整数运算）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数值范围</td>\n<td>极大（动态指数）</td>\n<td>有限（需手选标度，易溢出）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>精度分布</td>\n<td>随量级自适应</td>\n<td>全程恒定步长，远处精度浪费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>硬件原生，快</td>\n<td>整数乘法 + 移位，通常更快或相当</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>心智负担</td>\n<td>低（直接写公式）</td>\n<td>高（手管标度、溢出、除法）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生态</td>\n<td>引擎/物理库原生</td>\n<td>需自建数学库与物理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"浮点为何会跨平台分叉\">浮点为何会跨平台分叉</h2><p>罪魁是三个。其一，FMA：表达式 <code>a*b + c</code> 在有 FMA 的硬件上被融合成一条指令，乘积保留全精度后只舍入一次；在没有 FMA 的硬件上分两步，舍入两次。两者末位可能差一个 ULP（最小可表示单位）。其二，扩展精度：x87 历史上用 80 位寄存器保存中间结果，何时把它截回 64 位由编译器决定，于是优化档位一变结果就变。其三，<code>-ffast-math</code>：它授权编译器假设浮点满足结合律、不出现 NaN/Inf，从而自由重排——这等于主动放弃可复现性。用数学语言说，问题在于浮点加法不满足结合律：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(a + b) + c \\neq a + (b + c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>在末位上成立，所以「同样的数、不同的运算顺序」就给不同结果。Box2D 在 2024 年的确定性复盘里明确点名 fast-math、FMA 和平台各异的 <code>atan2f</code> 是三大障碍（box2d.org/posts/2024/08/determinism）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"驯服浮点-能做到-但要付纪律\">驯服浮点：能做到，但要付纪律</h2><p>浮点并非不能确定，而是需要把上面三个自由地带全部锁死：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>编译时禁用 <code>-ffast-math</code>，强制严格浮点语义（如 <code>-ffp-contract=off</code> 关掉 FMA 融合）。</li>\n<li>不直接调用平台 <code>libm</code> 的 <code>sin</code>/<code>cos</code>/<code>atan2</code>，改用一份所有平台共享的、逐位确定的软件数学库实现。</li>\n<li>限定目标平台严格遵守 IEEE 754-2008。Rapier 物理引擎正是走这条路——它在文档里声明「可选地在所有严格遵守 IEEE 754-2008 的 32/64 位平台上做到跨平台确定」（rapier.rs/docs 的 determinism 章）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这条路的代价是：你被绑死在「能严格遵守标准的平台子集」上，且每加一个新平台都要重新验证。它的好处是保留浮点的范围与直觉，物理公式照常写。把这套约束落到物理求解的具体做法，见 <a href=\"../deterministic-sim/deterministic-physics\">确定性物理</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"定点数-用整数换确定\">定点数：用整数换确定</h2><p>定点数把小数塞进整数。取 32 位整数、约定低 16 位为小数部分（Q16.16 格式），数值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 就存为整数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>16</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lfloor x \\times 2^{16} \\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">16</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span>。加减是直接的整数加减；乘法需要先扩到 64 位再右移，避免溢出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>⊗</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mtext>int</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mtext>int</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>16</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x \\otimes y = \\frac{(x_{\\text{int}} \\times y_{\\text{int}})}{2^{16}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">16</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">int</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">int</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>因为全程是整数运算，而整数运算在所有平台上逐位一致，定点数天然跨平台确定。代价有三：范围有限（Q16.16 最大约 32767，物理量级稍大就溢出，需谨慎选标度甚至用 64 位 Q32.32）；精度恒定（无论数大数小步长都是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{-16}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">16</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，在大坐标处浪费精度、在小量处又可能不够）；以及生态空白——超越函数要查表或多项式逼近，物理引擎多半得自建。前述的 Klotho 等确定性框架就采用 FP64 定点核心来换取「engine-agnostic、跨平台逐帧可复现」（github.com/xpTURN/Klotho）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"怎么选\">怎么选</h2><p>经验法则按「平台多样性」与「数值动态范围」两轴判断。若你只发布到少数严格 IEEE 754 平台、且物理量级温和，驯服浮点是更省力的选择，能复用现成引擎。若你要跨 PC、主机、移动、Web（WASM）多端逐帧一致，尤其要做回滚那种「每帧重算多次、零容忍」的场景，定点数的「天然确定」往往值回它的心智负担——许多 RTS 与联机格斗最终都倒向定点。无论选哪条，记住数值表示只是确定性链条的一环：循环顺序、随机数、容器遍历同样要管，它们分别由 <a href=\"../deterministic-sim/deterministic-update-loop\">确定性更新循环</a> 和 <a href=\"../deterministic-sim/rng-determinism\">随机数确定性</a> 处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>IEEE 754 保证 <code>+ - * / sqrt</code> 正确舍入，但超越函数、中间精度、FMA、fast-math 是跨平台分叉的来源。</li>\n<li>根本症结：浮点加法不满足结合律，运算顺序一变末位就变。</li>\n<li>驯服浮点可行（禁 fast-math/FMA、自实现数学库、限定 IEEE 754 平台），代价是平台受限与持续验证。</li>\n<li>定点数用整数运算换天然确定，代价是范围有限、精度恒定、生态需自建；多平台 + 回滚场景常倒向它。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"sources-nondeterminism\">非确定性来源</a>——本篇是其中「数值层」的展开。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../deterministic-sim/deterministic-physics\">确定性物理</a>——把这些数值约束落到物理求解。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../game-physics/rigid-body-dynamics/newtonian-mechanics\">游戏物理 · 牛顿力学</a>——物理公式本身，本篇只管让它可复现。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"定点数与浮点","id":"定点数与浮点"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"浮点为何会跨平台分叉","id":"浮点为何会跨平台分叉"},{"level":2,"text":"驯服浮点：能做到，但要付纪律","id":"驯服浮点-能做到-但要付纪律"},{"level":2,"text":"定点数：用整数换确定","id":"定点数-用整数换确定"},{"level":2,"text":"怎么选","id":"怎么选"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"非确定性来源","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-replay-determinism/foundations/sources-nondeterminism"},"next":{"title":"确定性更新循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-replay-determinism/deterministic-sim/deterministic-update-loop"}}